{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "title00aaaaaaaaa1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 200,
      "y": -260,
      "width": 3000,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "# Experiment Matrix — Paper Architecture\n*Instructional / 指导性 (NOT status tracking)*\n**Cascade DOM → Phantom-DOM → Phantom-SoM → SoM** + Vision parallel · Phantom space (2 arms) · + Router · + Deploy"
    },

    {
      "id": "scopeglobalaaaaa1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 200,
      "y": -90,
      "width": 3000,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "**Sites (6)**: VWA cls 234 / red 210 / shop 466 + WA red 106 / shop 192 / sa 182 = ~1390 task/condition  |  **Models (3)**: B0 Qwen3-VL-235B + B1 Qwen3-VL-4B + Claude Opus 4.7  |  **Modes (5)**: DOM / SoM / Vision / **Phantom-DOM** / **Phantom-SoM**  |  **Cells**: 6 × 3 × 5 = **90 baseline cells (~125K episode total)**"
    },

    {
      "id": "cascade_groupaaa1",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -100,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 3300,
      "height": 540,
      "color": "5",
      "label": "CASCADE — Token-monotonic representation upgrade path (paper §1 hook)"
    },

    {
      "id": "mode_dom00aaaaaa1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## DOM\n*origin baseline*\n\n• text: AXTree (hierarchical)\n• prompt: DOM\n• image: ✗\n• cost: ~3K text\n\n**测什么**: text-only baseline, hierarchical tree-traversal trajectory\n\n**Section 4** baseline\n**Phantom space**: ✅ origin (M1 ❌ M2 ❌)"
    },

    {
      "id": "mode_pdomzzzaaaaa1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "## Phantom-DOM\n*axis 1: text format swap (DOM-prompt 锚)*\n\n• text: **`[SOM_MARKS]`** flat list (regex filter from AXTree)\n• prompt: DOM (unchanged)\n• image: ✗\n• cost: ~3K text\n\n**测什么**: 文本 ontology shift — hierarchical → flat indexed (browse → select); M2 flat-list activation\n\n**Section 5** axis 1 mechanism (Format-swap subspace)\n**Phantom space**: ✅ arm 1 (M1 ❌ M2 ✅)"
    },

    {
      "id": "mode_psomaaaaaaa1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1360,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## Phantom-SoM ⭐\n*axis 1+2 compound (cube center, paper hero)*\n\n• text: `[SOM_MARKS]`\n• prompt: SoM-style\n• image: ✗\n• cost: ~3K text\n\n**测什么**: M1 ⊕ M2 compound activation — visual prompting w/o image + flat-list scanning. Emergent unique tasks (B0 red 3 tasks 既不在 Phantom-DOM 也不在 SoM)\n\n**Section 5** paper hero, mechanism centerpiece\n**Phantom space**: ✅ arm 2 (M1 ✅ M2 ✅ compound)"
    },

    {
      "id": "mode_som000aaaaa1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2060,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## SoM\n*image-on cube endpoint (NOT phantom)*\n\n• text: `[SOM_MARKS]`\n• prompt: SoM\n• image: ✓ (annotated screenshot)\n• cost: ~3K text + ~1.5K image\n\n**测什么**: full multimodal baseline — paper baseline 比较锚\n\n**Section 4** baseline\n**Section 5** axis 3 endpoint (vs Phantom-SoM isolate image effect)\n**Phantom space**: ❌ image-on out-of-space"
    },

    {
      "id": "mode_vision0aaaa1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2660,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Vision\n*image-only mode (cube 之外, axis 1 = no text)*\n\n• text: ∅\n• prompt: SoM-like\n• image: ✓ (raw screenshot)\n• cost: ~1.5K image\n\n**测什么**: pure visual baseline — counter-evidence (Phantom 不是 mode-specific artifact, Vision 也 affected)\n\n**Section 4** baseline (3rd axis)\n**Phantom space**: ❌ cube 之外"
    },

    {
      "id": "cascade_arrow1aa1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 605,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 60,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "**axis 1**\n→\n*text*"
    },

    {
      "id": "cascade_arrow2aa1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1305,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 60,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "**axis 2**\n→\n*prompt*"
    },

    {
      "id": "cascade_arrow3aa1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2005,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 60,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "**axis 3**\n→\n*image*"
    },

    {
      "id": "phantom_groupaaa1",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -100,
      "y": 640,
      "width": 1500,
      "height": 460,
      "color": "5",
      "label": "PHANTOM ROUTING SPACE — boundary: no annotated image (paper §2 Zoom 1)"
    },

    {
      "id": "phantom_arm1aaaa1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 720,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "## Arm 1: Phantom-DOM\n*axis 1 alone (M2 flat-list)*\n\nFormat-swap subspace — DOM-prompt + [SOM_MARKS] flat list\n\nB0 red drop-one +3.81pp [0.95, 5.24] sig\nB0 cls drop-one +3.42pp sig"
    },

    {
      "id": "phantom_arm2aaaa1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 720,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## Arm 2: Phantom-SoM ⭐\n*axis 1+2 compound (M1 ⊕ M2)*\n\nMirage subspace + flat-list — SoM-prompt + [SOM_MARKS]\n\nB0 red drop-one +3.33pp sig + 3 unique emergent tasks\nB0 cls drop-one +2.56pp sig\n\n**Cube center, paper hero**"
    },

    {
      "id": "fold4_groupaaaaaa",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1430,
      "y": 640,
      "width": 1770,
      "height": 460,
      "color": "4",
      "label": "4-FOLD DROP-IN PROPERTY (phantom arms 共享 by construction)"
    },

    {
      "id": "fold4_card_aaaaa1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1480,
      "y": 720,
      "width": 1670,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## 4 phantom arms 共享:\n\n**(a) cost ≈ DOM** — no image embedding tax (regex filter, ~3K text both)\n**(b) latency ~50% lower** — no image inference stage (cls 4×)\n**(c) signal AUROC ≥ baseline** ✅ — emergent (5/5 phantom `overall_usable=True`, red P-text 0.793 = 5-mode max)\n**(d) drop-one oracle 1.7-3.8pp per arm** ✅ — emergent (B0 red CI 全 exclude 0)\n\n*(a)(b) definitional / (c)(d) emergent — definition-then-validation 双层结构*\n\n**Strategic value**: phantom-class deployment — same routing infra, ~50% latency, signal stays usable"
    },

    {
      "id": "section_groupaaa1",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -100,
      "y": 1140,
      "width": 3300,
      "height": 600,
      "color": "4",
      "label": "PAPER SECTION → CELL MAPPING (which experiments serve which section)"
    },

    {
      "id": "section4_baseline",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 1220,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## §4 Empirical Findings (baseline)\n*needs*: DOM / SoM / Vision × 6 sites × 3 models = **54 baseline cells**\n\nCross-mode SR comparison + cost/latency/AUROC table.\nFigures: SR per mode, cost-SR Pareto, regional carbon."
    },

    {
      "id": "section5_mechaani",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 1220,
      "width": 1080,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## §5 Mechanism (phantom arms) ⭐\n*needs*: Phantom-DOM + Phantom-SoM × 6 sites × 3 models = **36 phantom cells**\n\nM1/M2 activation analysis + drop-one oracle per arm + axis ablation isolation + lit anchors (Mirage / Scaffold / Sclar / Q5 bidirectional)."
    },

    {
      "id": "section7_general",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2180,
      "y": 1220,
      "width": 1020,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## §7 Generalization\n*needs*: cross-site (VWA + WA = 6 sites) × cross-model (B0 + B1 + Claude)\n\nB1 Qwen3-VL-4B = capability scaling axis.\nClaude Opus 4.7 = model family generalization.\nWA = benchmark family generalization."
    },

    {
      "id": "section6_routing0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 1480,
      "width": 1620,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## §6 Routing — paper真正最值钱工作量 ⭐\n*needs*: routing infra + per-task feature extraction + multi-arm decision\n\n**Signals to route on**:\n• disagreement-cluster (cross-mode error pattern per task)\n• capability (B0 vs B1 vs Claude affinity per task type)\n• category (task-type intent classifier)"
    },

    {
      "id": "section8_susstain",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1680,
      "y": 1480,
      "width": 1520,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## §8 Discussion (sustainability + Green AI)\n*multi-metric Pareto: cost / latency / carbon*\n\nfig9 regional carbon sensitivity (45 region, India 632 / Norway 29 g/kWh).\nB1 measured energy + B0 token-based estimator.\n4-fold drop-in summary."
    },

    {
      "id": "router_groupaaaaa",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -100,
      "y": 1780,
      "width": 1620,
      "height": 460,
      "color": "3",
      "label": "+ ROUTER — Build router using disagreement-cluster / capability / category signals"
    },

    {
      "id": "router_signaaaaa1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 1860,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Routing signals\n\n**1. Disagreement-cluster**\n  per-task pattern of B0/B1/mode 错误一致 vs 分歧 → 9-cat clusters → arm 选\n\n**2. Capability**\n  per-task affinity score (B0 235B vs B1 4B vs Claude); routes harder tasks 强 model\n\n**3. Category**\n  task-type intent classifier (info-seek / transact / N/A / etc.) → arm 偏好"
    },

    {
      "id": "router_archaaaaa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 1860,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Routing architecture\n\n**Tier 1**: offline supervised oracle\n  TF-IDF (task instruction) + binary {has_ref_image, has_finish_string_match} → LR / RF\n  *predicts arm choice from task features alone*\n\n**Tier 2**: online first-step trigger\n  cheap mode (DOM) step 1 → trigger signal (response confidence / action diversity / behavioral signals) → escalate to expensive arm\n  *no test-time leakage (step-1 obs ≠ task feature)*"
    },

    {
      "id": "deploy_groupaaaaa",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1580,
      "y": 1780,
      "width": 1620,
      "height": 460,
      "color": "2",
      "label": "+ DEPLOY — Actually run agent with router, measure cost/SR/latency vs best-single-mode"
    },

    {
      "id": "deploy_runaaaaaaa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1640,
      "y": 1860,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Deploy: actual end-to-end agent run\n\n**Setup**:\n• router 选 arm per task\n• runner instantiates chosen arm (DOM / SoM / Vision / Phantom-DOM / Phantom-SoM)\n• run agent end-to-end on test split\n\n**Measure**:\n• SR (vs best-single-mode oracle)\n• cost (token + electricity)\n• P95 latency\n• carbon (regional sensitivity)"
    },

    {
      "id": "deploy_compaaaaa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 1860,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Deploy: comparison baseline\n\n**Beat what?**\n• random arm pick\n• best-single-mode (e.g. always SoM)\n• rule-based (e.g. has_image → Vision)\n• oracle (upper bound, knows true best per task)\n• learned router (Tier 1 + Tier 2)\n\n**Pareto**: cost vs SR vs latency curve\n**Cumulative SR vs Budget**: cost-aware 顶刊套路 ⭐"
    },

    {
      "id": "navigation_aaaaa1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -100,
      "y": 2270,
      "width": 3300,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "**Cross-canvas navigation**: paper §2 Evidence ⫨ Explanation 双 layer detail → `paper_section2_framework.canvas` | live status → `cells.base` views | strategy 脉络 → `paper_planning.md` §1+§2+§5+§8 | doc workflow → `paper_planning.md §20`"
    }
  ],

